<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-23344] Fix incorrect snapshot creation log message</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-23344</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;While creating full snapshot it writes wrong message, like incremental index is created with index = -1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
[2024-10-02T18:22:36,020][INFO ][test-runner-#1%snapshot.IncrementalSnapshotTest%][IgniteSnapshotManager] Cluster-wide snapshot operation started [snpName=testSnapshot_false_, grps=[&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;, MetaStorage], incremental=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;, incrementIndex=-1]&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reproduce with ign.snapshot().createSnapshot(&quot;snpName&quot;).get(). Check logs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Let&apos;s log `SnapshotOperationRequest` instead params. Similar to &quot;Cluster-wide snapshot operation finished&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Let&apos;s add test in `IgniteSnapshotManagerSelfTest` using `LogListener`.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
